{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29032","headline":"秋日早朝 · 许浑","name":"秋日早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宵衣应待绝更筹，环佩锵锵月下楼。\n井转辘轳千树晓，鏁开阊阖万山秋。\n龙旗尽列趋金殿，雉扇才分见玉旒。\n虚戴铁冠无一事，沧江归去老渔舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}